  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equations of direction cosies</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>From equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Dividing by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;on both sides<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Case 1</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0em\" columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0em\" columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Case 2</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
